.SH DESCRIPTION
Print upterm's version, with its git commit and build date when known.

.PP
Exit status: 0, or 1 on failure.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for version

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	Output format: json, with version, gitCommit and buildDate (command line only)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
